      "title": "EXT. COASTAL ROAD - DAWN",
      "subtitle": "Coastal Road · Dawn",
      "ambient": 45,
      "notes": "FICTIONAL DEMO — THE LAST LIGHT\nOriginal Production Desk screenplay. All characters are fictional adults.\nLocation: North coast (fictional).\n\n1 EXT. COASTAL ROAD - DAWN\n\nA battered station wagon follows the coast. The lighthouse is a pin of light in the mist.\n\nMAYA\nWe should have left yesterday.\n\nELI\nAnd missed all this?\n\nDEMO NOTES\nMaya and Eli drive toward the lighthouse.\nBlocking, equipment, dates and take data are illustrative testing examples. Use Play scene; inspect camera links, lenses, lighting and shot coverage. Export updated shots from Production Desk and import the CSV here to update matching scene/shot numbers without replacing maps. No automatic sync.",
